## summary (non-binding)

this is **not the license**. the binding text is sections 1 through 11 above. this summary is just a tl;dr.

- you can read the source, run it locally, learn from it, and reuse code (small fragments or larger chunks) in any project that isn't itself a cryptocurrency wallet.
- the only thing the additional use grant blocks is **shipping an end-user cryptocurrency wallet** built on this code. custody services, signing services, key management services, MPC infra, dapps, indexers, libraries, agents, dev tools, research projects, etc. are all fine - take whatever helps.
- on **2030-05-03** the entire codebase auto-converts to Apache License 2.0, after which everything in this repo is permissively licensed (no restrictions at all).
- chromatika is provided as is. the licensor and contributors are not liable for any losses, lost funds, leaked keys, missed transactions, exploited bugs, or any other damages from using or being unable to use chromatika. you assume 100% of the risk.
- nothing here is financial advice.
- chromatika is pre-release. don't use real funds.

if you want to ship a wallet built on chromatika, contact the licensor for a commercial license.
